<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμύ̆-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snuff</i> a lamp, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λύχνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					249
				</span></i>
			 (prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόβυσον,</span> cf.
			Sch.ad loc., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.103
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.798b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>extort money from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Praec.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύχνον ἑαυτὸν προμύσσουτα</span> a lamp
			which <i>trims</i> itself, <i>pushes out</i> its own
			<i>wick,</i> dub. cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσμύσσοντα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.34
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
